attributes using ergm? i.e. first, how such data should be entered, and 
second, how it is dealt with in the model itself. in the past i have 
used primarily categorical attributes, and so i just dealt with this by 
including the missing data code as part of the "base" for nodefactor 
terms and omitting the missing data code using the "keep" function for 
nodematch terms, but currently i have missing data on some continuous 
attributes and am not sure how i should deal with this (or if this is 
even possible). thanks very much!

-kevin

p.s. please forgive me if i've missed a prior message on this topic- the 
most recent post i can find in the archive is a note from mark handcock 
back in 2009:

"statnet does recognize missing data on vertex attributes...
