simulate.ergm mentions "dynamic" draws which do not seem to be described; what are
"dynamic draws"?

ergm version 2.3

thanks!
Hugh
-- 
Hugh J. Devlin, Ph. D.
hdevlin@northwestern.edu

Arguments

sequential Should the returned draws use the prior draw as the starting network or
always use the initially passed network? For random draws the results should be
similar (stochastically), but the sequential=TRUE option is useful for dynamic
draws.


