From buttsc at uci.edu  Mon May  2 18:37:31 2011
From: buttsc at uci.edu (Carter T. Butts)
Date: Thu Jun  7 11:20:33 2018
Subject: [statnet_help] ergm question
In-Reply-To: <000401cc08eb$931ba120$b952e360$@itesm.mx>
