Hi, Adrian. Currently, geodist computes all-pairs shortest paths. 
Although I have code in the backend to do single-pair shortest paths, 
it's not currently a user-level function; since the complexity isn't 
_that_ different, there's not been any demand for it.  If you and others 
are interested, though, I'll put that in the hopper for the next release....

-Carter

